    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><a href=\"https://www.pronamic.eu/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Pronamic</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/pronamic/wp-salesfeed\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">GitHub</a></p>\n<p>A very easy WordPress plugin wich adds a <a href=\"http://salesfeed.nl/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">SalesFeed</a> tracking code to your WordPress. The tracking code can be configured on the SalesFeed settings page under your WordPress admin settings page.</p>\n<h3>Pronamic plugins</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/pronamic-google-maps/\" rel=\"ugc\">Pronamic Google Maps</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/pronamic-ideal/\" rel=\"ugc\">Pronamic Pay</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Extract the zip file and just drop the contents in the wp-content/plugins/ directory of your<br />\nWordPress installation and then activate the Plugin from Plugins page.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<p><!-- Start changelog --></p>\n<h3>[1.3.5] &#8211; 2024-11-21</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>No significant changes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>[1.3.4] &#8211; 2024-11-21</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>No significant changes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/pronamic/wp-salesfeed/compare/v1.3.2...v1.3.3\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">1.3.3</a> &#8211; 2024-09-05</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>No significant changes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/pronamic/wp-salesfeed/commits/v1.3.1...v1.3.2\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">1.3.2</a> &#8211; 2024-09-05</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>No significant changes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/pronamic/wp-salesfeed/commits/v1.3.0...v1.3.1\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">1.3.1</a> &#8211; 2024-09-05</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>No significant changes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/pronamic/wp-salesfeed/commits/v1.2.0...v1.3.0\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">1.3.0</a> &#8211; 2024-09-05</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed calling non-static method statically.</li>\n<li>Updated tested up to version.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/pronamic/wp-salesfeed/commits/v1.1.0...v1.2.0\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">1.2.0</a> &#8211; 2018-05-24</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated tested up to version.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/pronamic/wp-salesfeed/commits/v1.0.0...v1.1.0\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">1.1.0</a> &#8211; 2015-07-30</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated to new SalesFeed script.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/pronamic/wp-salesfeed/commits/v1.0.0\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">1.0.0</a> &#8211; 2013-11-18</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><!-- End changelog --></p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Add a SalesFeed tracking code to your WordPress site. You need a SalesFeed account.",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://www.pronamic.eu/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Pronamic</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/pronamic/wp-salesfeed\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">GitHub</a></p>\n<p>A very easy WordPress plugin wich adds a <a href=\"http://salesfeed.nl/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">SalesFeed</a> tracking code to your WordPress. The tracking code can be configured on the SalesFeed settings page under your WordPress admin settings page.</p>\n<h3>Pronamic plugins</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/pronamic-google-maps/\" rel=\"ugc\">Pronamic Google Maps</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/pronamic-ideal/\" rel=\"ugc\">Pronamic Pay</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
